    "updated_at": "2020-12-04T17:28:27Z",
    "body": "I guess for bash you could record the value of `$BASH_COMMAND` in the `DEBUG` trap, then refer to it the next time the prompt is invoked – though I appreciate that you'd probably rather not start implementing features ad-hoc that don't work in half the supported shells.",
