    "updated_at": "2020-12-05T03:10:41Z",
    "body": "Yeah, I'm not fundamentally opposed to supporting it (and a lot of other neat features that people have proposed), we just need to figure out a way to do it that's either cross-shell or to specify some set of support tiers. Unfortunately, we're not quite ready to do either of those yet (so it's not happening right now), but we definitely *are* taking these types of requests into consideration.",
